{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "That's Christmas To Me felt like a natural choice because Christmas albums recur throughout my history, giving me a clear reason to try it.",
    "Buon Natale: The Christmas Album also matched that holiday interest, even though I only wanted to try one album this visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Merle Haggard collection and the live opera-house recording did not connect clearly to the Christmas listening that made me interested in the two holiday albums.",
    "Titles such as Heritage, Hope, and Forte gave me too little evidence of a connection to my listening interests to make me want to explore them today."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seemed to treat a broad connection to vocal music as enough, while the Christmas theme was my clearest reason for choosing an album.",
    "A greatest-hits collection or live performance did not appeal to me simply because I had listened to other albums; I needed a more specific connection."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated Christmas-album interactions were a stronger clue for this visit than a loose resemblance to other music.",
    "An album can fit my interests without being something I choose immediately: Buon Natale interested me, but one strong choice was enough today."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my Christmas interest in two clear matches but stretched that interest too broadly across the remaining albums."
}"}
